# Documentation

- Keep docs concise. Update the README or handler docstring when behavior changes.
- Document the "why" (intent, trade-offs, constraints), not the "what".
- Comment only non-obvious logic - never narrate what the code plainly does.
- Keep each service README to: purpose, how to run, env vars, and key endpoints.
